# pop'n music 9, after popn9-card-new.his (same --nvram): the registered card, PIN 1234, EXPERT, the
# first course (Fancy), buttons pressed throughout. The course fails in its first song; the game
# still sends rank.register (card, name in hex Shift-JIS, score...) and shows INTERNET RANKING
# with the place the server gives ("... 4位 4人中").
#   hiraku-popn9 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-card-expert.his
